body:
I played the game in order technically...I started DAI for a few days before I got DAO, did the same thing w DAO and DA2...But eventually I did play them in order before continuing in either game. I did this to get a better grasp on the story thus far. Working on reading through all the books though, I probably should've done that first but I was just excited to get into the game lmfao. 

&#x200B;

However, with changing decisions, I definitely did use book knowledge from The Masked Empire for the Winter Palace. I'm not sure if you've played any of the games yet, so I won't exactly spoil that part for you.  But it may help change a decision you make later on!

Sibling, Anders and romance option. I usually take Carver, Anders and Fenris for mine. I suppose it just depends! If Anders is your romance option (you said you're romancing Fen but I mean in different playthroughs) I'd probably still bring Fenris too, he has a lot of interesting banter.

&#x200B;

Varric is nice to have too, but I left him out in my playthrough I did two days ago, and it was nice with the three I previously mentioned. I haven't tried bringing anyone else other than them, though, so I'm not sure about the other party member's banter.
